    <item>
      <title>Choking Iran's Economy Is the Least Bad Way to End the War</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-08-20/choking-iran-s-economy-is-the-least-bad-way-to-end-the-war</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">a4185d6b80eab6dae9450932</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 03:00:01 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Over the years, I’ve witnessed at first-hand countries going literally broke under US economic pressure: Iraq, Venezuela and Cuba. The scenes I saw in Baghdad, Caracas and Havana were all very similar. The national currency became worthless, inflation skyrocketed and unemployment spiraled higher. And yet, American economic sanctions alone failed to force political change.</description>
      <dc:creator>Javier Blas</dc:creator>
